{"availability":"available","full":"majidmanzarpour/threejs-procedural-dungeon","name":"threejs-procedural-dungeon","description":"Real-time procedural dungeon generator in Three.js - deterministic seeds, Delaunay/MST graph layouts, room semantics, five themes, and a custom bloom/tilt-shift pipeline.","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":509,"forks":85,"created":"2026-07-05T21:15:08Z","updated":"2026-07-05T21:19:53Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"","topics":[],"demo":"https://procedural-dungeon.netlify.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T15:54:27.626Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T15:54:27.626Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T15:54:27.626Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T21:33:04.668Z","stars":507,"forks":84},{"at":"2026-10-08T00:28:06.852Z","stars":508,"forks":84},{"at":"2026-10-10T03:21:57.804Z","stars":508,"forks":84},{"at":"2026-10-15T16:59:23.846Z","stars":509,"forks":85},{"at":"2026-10-19T15:54:27.626Z","stars":509,"forks":85}],"technologies":["Three.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A deterministic procedural dungeon generator you can watch build itself, room by room. Rooms are scattered and shoved apart, triangulated, wired into a corridor graph, carved into a tile grid, and dressed with theme-specific props, liquids, lights, and particles — every stage seeded from a single number, so any seed rebuilds the exact same dungeon. Rendered live with Three.js.","Type a seed, pick a theme, drag the sliders, and watch the pipeline light up stage by stage. Every forge is reproducible and every dungeon is guaranteed fully connected."],"features":["One seed, one dungeon. A single mulberry32 stream is threaded through every stage —","scatter, separation, triangulation, room roles, carving, decoration. The same seed always yields the same map, down to the last torch. Change one digit and get an entirely new floor.","A real generation pipeline, visualized. Watch it run: scatter → separate → Delaunay →","MST + loops → semantics → carve → rasterize + BFS → decorate. Each step lights up in the HUD as it happens, and you can scrub the whole build animation or skip it.","Graph-based layouts. Rooms are Delaunay-triangulated, reduced to a minimum spanning tree"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/majidmanzarpour/threejs-procedural-dungeon/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"bb0cf36fbe6773ebe00b68f00c9ea33d73826e95ec0836e6fb7fe549f9ac2444","extractedAt":"2026-10-05T21:33:04.760Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T17:03:07.069Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A deterministic procedural dungeon generator you can watch build itself, room by room. Rooms are scattered and shoved apart, triangulated, wired into a corridor graph, carved into a tile grid, and dressed with theme-specific props, liquids, lights, and particles — every stage seeded from a single number, so any seed rebuilds the exact same dungeon. Rendered live with Three.js.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/majidmanzarpour/threejs-procedural-dungeon/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"bb0cf36fbe6773ebe00b68f00c9ea33d73826e95ec0836e6fb7fe549f9ac2444","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/majidmanzarpour/threejs-procedural-dungeon/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T17:03:07.069Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-07-05T21:19:53Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/majidmanzarpour/threejs-procedural-dungeon/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T04:07:07.419Z","hash":"bb0cf36fbe6773ebe00b68f00c9ea33d73826e95ec0836e6fb7fe549f9ac2444","originalBytes":8840,"storedBytes":8840,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T21:33:04.668Z","demoHealth":{"url":"https://procedural-dungeon.netlify.app/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-20T00:28:13.027Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-20T00:28:13.027Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-20T00:28:13.027Z","target":"https://procedural-dungeon.netlify.app/","fai